<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφαρπάζω</span></b> , fut.
		
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άξω,</span>
		
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσομαι</span>:—
			Pass.
		, pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήρπασμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					9.18
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηρπάσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.4.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηρπάγην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IPE</u>
					1.26
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Olbia</span>): —<i>tear off</i>
			or <i>from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἕκτωρ δ᾽ ὡρμήθη κόρυθα . . κρατὸς
					ἀφαρπάξαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.189
				</span></i>
			; <i>snatch away, steal from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					1062
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. only, <i>snatch eagerly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				548
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1178
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸν στέφανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.64
				</span></i>
			; of death, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(7).52.9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				19.31
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωτὸς ἀφαρπασθείς,</span> of
			one <i>dead,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				14.1386
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				12(7).400
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>).</div>
